    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> First Episode of &quot;Not a Good Fairy Tale&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Palaces of The Mind</strong> is a 2D mystical adventure that tells the story of how the most ordinary day of two friends turned into a nightmare. Becca, her owl Dolly, and Meg must now escape from the world of animeds, forest creatures that can smell fear. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over time, they realize that this world is not as simple as it seems at first glance, but finding all the secrets will not be easy.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will anyone help them on this adventure? Who knows? Maybe it will be you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[A mystical story about the escape of two girls in the world of animeds]</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[The ability to change the main character]</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Puzzles of varying difficulty]</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Easter eggs and hidden plot twists]</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Original soundtrack]</p></li></ul>",
